   "key": "sample.diameter.max",
   "why": "The 5.00 in [127.0 mm] dimension is on drawing CH1A600, but it is the cold-tip heat-exchanger diameter, not a sample-size limit. A bare cooler with no enclosure does not cap the load diameter at its cold flange: larger loads bolt to it inside a user-supplied vessel. This also contradicts the configuration's own basis ('no ... sample space') and the not_available sample.height.max. Should be not_available like sample.height.max, or unknown."
